* File output and $monitor-type tasks in a transient run (2.12.0).
* A 1 V step charges C1 through R1 (RC = 1 ms); models/tasks/rc_logger.va watches `out`.
* Expected, from V(out) = 1 - exp(-t/RC) and level = floor(4 V(out)):
*   - target/rc_logger_points.txt: one line per accepted timepoint, `t V(out)`;
*   - target/rc_logger_levels.txt and stdout: one line per level entered, at the first accepted
*     point in it -- level 0 at t=0, then 1, 2, 3 near RC*ln(4/3)=0.288 ms, RC*ln 2=0.693 ms,
*     RC*ln 4=1.386 ms (the first accepted point at or past each);
*   - nothing at the points in between: $fmonitor prints only on a change.
* Run: va-cli sim circuits/tasks/rc_logger.net --model models/tasks --tran --report out
V1 in gnd 1.0
R1 in out 1000
C1 out gnd 1e-6
X1 out rc_logger
.tran 100u 3m UIC
.end
